{"4709580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stow Away", "steam_appid": 4709580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/0e00b3398dd81510186535dfac2df332.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1400 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aboard a drifting cargo ship, something has gone terribly wrong.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>STOW AWAY</i> is a first-person survival horror experience where you must navigate tight corridors, storm soaked decks, and lightless hulls while being hunted by something that does not belong in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were never part of the crew... and that could save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/0dcb696bd90f06b84fd6357e98752cfd.poster.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/0dcb696bd90f06b84fd6357e98752cfd.webm?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/0dcb696bd90f06b84fd6357e98752cfd.mp4?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/75d107e4351bcadd6f41e2f3746248ed.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1400 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have no weapons. No authority. No place on this ship.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a stowaway, you exist in the margins, crawling through maintenance shafts, slipping between containers, and scavenging what little the ship hasn’t already claimed. The truth of what happened here reveals itself slowly, scattered across logs, environments, and the echoes of those who didn’t make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And through it all, a lone voice from the bridge offers guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helpful… or desperate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/8faa0450f7b47e28a341a91ef5f6238c.poster.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/8faa0450f7b47e28a341a91ef5f6238c.webm?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/8faa0450f7b47e28a341a91ef5f6238c.mp4?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/0160bf173ca1ad1723de8ee144636c96.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1400 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not just being hunted. You are being used.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw the creature away. Trigger distractions. Risk exposure to create opportunity. Survival means understanding that sometimes the only way forward… is to make yourself the target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/4e19b7a8ada8114f558fccd47bf0fd11.poster.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/4e19b7a8ada8114f558fccd47bf0fd11.webm?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/4e19b7a8ada8114f558fccd47bf0fd11.mp4?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/0e00b3398dd81510186535dfac2df332.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1400 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aboard a drifting cargo ship, something has gone terribly wrong.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>STOW AWAY</i> is a first-person survival horror experience where you must navigate tight corridors, storm soaked decks, and lightless hulls while being hunted by something that does not belong in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were never part of the crew... and that could save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/0dcb696bd90f06b84fd6357e98752cfd.poster.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/0dcb696bd90f06b84fd6357e98752cfd.webm?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/0dcb696bd90f06b84fd6357e98752cfd.mp4?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/75d107e4351bcadd6f41e2f3746248ed.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1400 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have no weapons. No authority. No place on this ship.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a stowaway, you exist in the margins, crawling through maintenance shafts, slipping between containers, and scavenging what little the ship hasn’t already claimed. The truth of what happened here reveals itself slowly, scattered across logs, environments, and the echoes of those who didn’t make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And through it all, a lone voice from the bridge offers guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helpful… or desperate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/8faa0450f7b47e28a341a91ef5f6238c.poster.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/8faa0450f7b47e28a341a91ef5f6238c.webm?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/8faa0450f7b47e28a341a91ef5f6238c.mp4?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/0160bf173ca1ad1723de8ee144636c96.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1400 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not just being hunted. You are being used.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw the creature away. Trigger distractions. Risk exposure to create opportunity. Survival means understanding that sometimes the only way forward… is to make yourself the target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/4e19b7a8ada8114f558fccd47bf0fd11.poster.avif?t=1778171865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/4e19b7a8ada8114f558fccd47bf0fd11.webm?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/extras/4e19b7a8ada8114f558fccd47bf0fd11.mp4?t=1778171865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Trapped on a cargo ship with cephalopodic horrors, Stow Away throws you headfirst into a survival horror experience. There’s little help aboard for a stowaway, except one man locked in the bridge, warning you of the dangers ahead. Can you find your sea legs in time to escape?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Finnish, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/965cfd1f66e760b328d611e33fb0d0bcf72d1c9b/header.jpg?t=1778171865", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/770bf5848aed3e821d46d0b1b6ea8ff7f255aa3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778171865", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709580/770bf5848aed3e821d46d0b1b6ea8ff7f255aa3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778171865", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-Core @ 2.5 GHz or superior<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "